# Software industry mapping for ARC
@prefix sw: <https://ecosystemcode.com/ontology/arc/software#> .
@prefix legacy: <https://example.com/legacy/software#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

legacy:product_architecture_decision owl:equivalentClass sw:ProductArchitectureDecision .
legacy:product_architecture_decision_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:productArchitectureDecisionId .
legacy:governs_product_edition rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:governsProductEdition .
